'''Island Defenders!''' (島を守りし者強襲！, ''Shima o Mamorishi Mono Kyōshū ！'', '''The Island Guardians' Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for the [[Summer Break Cats Castaway]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
Island Defenders! contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Cultural Exchange Lvs'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of an Cultural Exchange Lv. can include XP and Legend Traps. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Island Defenders!/Cultural Exchange Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Island Defenders! is unlocked after clearing ?

